minance of majority classes, whereas accuracy summarizes overall recognition performance. We first compute metrics on each LOSO fold, average them across folds for each seed, and then report the mean±standard deviation across seeds. All methods use identical dataset splits and evaluation procedures within each benchmark to ensure fair comparison. For PADS, we report Macro-F1 and balanced accuracy separately as an exploratory medical extension.
